This file is an explicit, human-authored transcription written under
CORR-20260917-8b80cc route.D2_route_S2 and TASK-20260917-93192a. It records, in
words, what the run package already states in RUN-QSP-33b442-S2/manifest.yaml:

  run.artifacts.stderr:
    "absent: stdout and stderr were merged into stdout.log by the launching
     shell"

The launching shell for this invocation redirected file descriptor 2 into file
descriptor 1. There was therefore no separate standard-error stream to capture:
the combined stream is the file stdout.log in this directory, and any diagnostic
this invocation emitted on fd 2 is interleaved there in emission order.

The bytes of stdout.log HAVE NOT BEEN COPIED HERE, and must never be. Copying
them would assert that they were observed arriving on fd 2, which is false: they
were observed on the merged fd 1 and their originating descriptor is no longer
recoverable from the artifact.

This file adds no observation, no number and no claim. RUN-QSP-33b442-S2 remains
status aborted_implementation_error, remains INVALID, and remains not evidence
of any kind about hypothesis H-QSP-5540d7. It is superseded as a measurement by
